      "text": "The number of insects N in a colony changes at a rate proportional to N, where t is measured in weeks. At \\( t = 0 \\), \\( N = 380 \\) insects, and at \\( t = 5 \\), \\( N = 190 \\) insects. Find an expression for \\( N(t) \\).",
